              "name": "Omgjsc"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Thank you Tanya for sharing. This was a moist bun...not dry like the ones in the store.\nBeing the \"health nut\" that I am, I substituted half of the flour with whole wheat flour. I used creamer instead of milk and I added 1 tsp of dark rum (as someone else had mentioned). I think the next time I make this (next week) I will use Guinness Stout instead of the beer. Ate it with sharp cheddar cheese. Yummy.\nI was able to make 2 loaves which filled the loaf pans about 3/4.",
